n choose to fearlessly fight or use your words as weapons, landing a crushing blow with just a well-worded whisper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/f7422afbd2c2c2a041e56ee0e1d3fcd1.poster.avif?t=1780883507\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/f7422afbd2c2c2a041e56ee0e1d3fcd1.webm?t=1780883507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/f7422afbd2c2c2a041e56ee0e1d3fcd1.mp4?t=1780883507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deftly dodge the relentless barrage of their bottled-up emotions, and discover the source of their strange stories. By touching their heart with your words, you might just be able to save their souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/da53a5b8d8fdf9debc06f54331374160.poster.avif?t=1780883507\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/da53a5b8d8fdf9debc06f54331374160.webm?t=1780883507\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649490/extras/da53a5b8d8fdf9debc06f54331374160.mp4?t=1780883507\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What other mysteries await you in this weird new world? Find out in <i>Stray Children</i> — an unfamiliar place, with all-too-familiar troubles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam